{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41678","headline":"豫章江楼望西山有怀 · 陈陶","name":"豫章江楼望西山有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水护星坛列太虚，烟霓十八上仙居。\n时人未识辽东鹤，吾祖曾传宝鼎书。\n终日章江催白鬓，何年丹竈见红蕖。\n桃花谷口春深浅，欲访仙生赤鲤鱼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41678.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41678","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}